# LLMReplay agent standards

- Follow [docs/dev/coding-standards.md](docs/dev/coding-standards.md).
- Use **Pydantic v2** for configs, manifests, and cross-module payloads (`extra="forbid"` unless SPEC allows extensions).
- Type-hint all public APIs; top-level imports only; Ruff-clean; double quotes.
- Amend `docs/SPEC.md` / `DESIGN.md` in the same change as behavior.
- Commit **once per completed chunk** after tests pass; update DESIGN progress in that commit.
- Code review / validation: use **cheap models only** (composer-2.5-fast, gpt-5.6-*-medium, grok, sonnet). **Never use Opus 4.6 for routine review.**
